    "text": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/d101280d-3230-4629-8579-8e3362dc1b41-image.png\" style=\"width: 327px; height: 220px;\" /></p><p>Angle of dip,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#948;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>30</mn><mo>&#176;</mo></math></p><p>Angle of dip or magnetic dip is the angle the net earth&#39;s magnetic field and it&#39;s horizontal component.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>B</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>B</mi><mi>cos</mi><mi>&#948;</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>B</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></msub><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mi>&#948;</mi></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p>Magnetic field,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac bevelled=\"true\"><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac bevelled=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac bevelled=\"true\"><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">G</mi></math>.</p>",
